  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--title",
      "type": "heading",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "In Patna\nFǎxiǎn’s Labours in Transcription of Manuscripts\nand Indian Studies for Three Years",
      "textSha256": "651e92f97bc245d71281fb9248d2a99ed8045189fbbe248009536370b49a2aba",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "ChaptTitle",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 82,
          "endByte": 186,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "4547a3d7163f1269a39f182c7d34627a77e8cdff096ae1aee9c47e44ab115b8d"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "headingBasis": "source-ChaptTitle-assignment"
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-01",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "In Patna\nFrom Varanasi (Bōluónài 波罗奈, i.e. Benares) the travelers went back east to Pataliputtra (Bāliánfú 巴连弗).",
      "textSha256": "df0eec8739f7e3fb09423943a449dea1c149f88b65c384d7f23e0feaea4093c6",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[1]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 200,
          "endByte": 416,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "a3510391545de34b93ddc0d4ee0eeee4e042bdc9043bf21a38d14a1514bbc374"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-02",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "Fǎxiǎn’s original object had been to search for copies of the Vinaya. In the various kingdoms of North India, however, he had found one master transmitting the rules orally to another, but no written copies which he could transcribe.",
      "textSha256": "875a4120a67ad79795a22b3bcacf368e6a1f35f9958ceba8b8a6d4465601a249",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[2]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 636,
          "endByte": 876,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "fdd4f3d6260948954839edcdd544ed6d9ad47fadb0288c49e438a05cbe1c8ab0"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-03",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "He had therefore traveled far and come on to Central India. Here, in the Mahayana monastery [mentioned in chapter 27], he found a copy of the Vinaya, containing the Mahasanghika rules (Móhē Sēnchí Zhònglǜ 摩诃僧祇众律 “Great Assembly”), those which were observed in the first Great Council, while the Buddha was still in the world.",
      "textSha256": "89214ae41d806617667d80cbdb1e4c1ec069279350147b9d3a73176d6fd7bbc7",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[3]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 1196,
          "endByte": 1573,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "8eeb8178404a2087a03b590d148c12e9a74cd89026061d302c52672d5704a10f"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-04",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "The original copy was handed down in the Jetavana (Zhīhuán 祗洹) vihara. As to the other eighteen schools, each one has the views and decisions of its own masters.",
      "textSha256": "b19ccfef70d418c2fe3fa6ceed25d03cd623b3a4684fe745597b27e97bd653f5",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[4]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 2091,
          "endByte": 2289,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "ce755cc08c5dccb217e21d4b71d13c2cadf3e260c4e97e8479eee6f174e722b1"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-05",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "Those agree with this one in the general meaning, but they have small and trivial differences, as when one opens and another shuts. This copy of the rules, however, is the most complete, with the fullest explanations. [Fǎxiǎn later translated it into Chinese. JL]",
      "textSha256": "6fdef3cd3bb87be26ffea726d2332fb61af9f73822907f6e26b2cf5950d72558",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[5]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 2554,
          "endByte": 2822,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "14e3b4cb3f37b4c99ba1c27dccd634eb68b17ddf658941f52838e5460a86a40a"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-06",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "He further got a transcript of the rules in six or seven thousand gathas [stanzas], being the sarvastivadah rules (sàpóduō zhènglǜ 萨婆多众律), those which are observed by the communities of monks in the land of Qín 秦 [China]; which also have all been handed down orally from master to master without being committed to writing.",
      "textSha256": "995e4acad89159015a5f4ea7023f734aab0fb02fcb207f5126c08ea4a87ec0ff",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[6]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 3156,
          "endByte": 3555,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "29bef7651fd14021e839694237ee56089e335d24e34f93e54dd9d642c27ab723"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-07",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "In the community here, moreover, he got the Samyuktabhi-dharma-hridaya-(sastra) (Zá’ē Pítán Xīn 杂阿毗昙心), containing about six or seven thousand gathas.",
      "textSha256": "2991bd064aef9909ff58825b0ca537d3934c92fba07e1a714a992b3083f692d9",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[7]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 4096,
          "endByte": 4293,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "30589fd5d8e228ad48fe385a57dca0f87956858bc52fcaa6585d27841147b4f0"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-08",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "He also got a Sutra of 2500 gathas; one chapter of the Parinir-vana-vaipulya Sutra (Fāngděng Bānníhuán Jīng 方等般泥洹经), of about 5000 gathas; and the Mahasan-ghikah Abhidharma (Móhēsēngchí Ēpítán 摩诃僧祇阿毗昙).",
      "textSha256": "950f0c9f4b899d18bb5d306b8b59a284fbd7610e45a21c99c473c22b8f5ebd06",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[8]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 4530,
          "endByte": 4828,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "4ca348c472f5e5d8d7667518d14613672d6ec49b523e120bd12c1c84b5c67526"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-09",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "Fǎxiǎn’s Labours in Transcription of Manuscripts and Indian Studies for Three Years\nIn consequence [of this success in his quest] Fǎxiǎn stayed here for three years, studying Sanskrit books and the Sanskrit speech, and writing out the Vinaya rules.",
      "textSha256": "274d1055cdc1ef85432fda94017971764cbf9b2efac3bef50c00f381e60cdb3d",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[9]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 5276,
          "endByte": 5561,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "2e9f6db248e4fb07114786805195496657ecabdeb484f049d002e48dbcef813b"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "When Dàozhěng arrived in the Central Kingdom, and saw the rules observed by the sramanas, and the dignified demeanour in their societies which he remarked under all occurring circumstances, he sadly called to mind in what a mutilated and imperfect condition the rules were among the monkish communities in the land of Qín.",
      "textSha256": "345d10e789af86b2a0b6342b517af8df1dc99e2a4919a6545840d85b28e31cf0",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[10]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 5804,
          "endByte": 6132,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "917e6c324fbaaa83282ecc9e2b03b32e37e4ddb6650a4f1ff8753edd18d95f7d"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "He made the following aspiration: “From this time forth till I come to the state of the Buddha, let me not be reborn in a frontier land [i.e., outside of India].” He remained accordingly in India, and did not return to the land of Hàn.",
      "textSha256": "d271a16aa93439aa58adf977999d981731f8072641d0c2cd725ae9dcb018f5a1",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[11]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 6600,
          "endByte": 6843,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "ead647e155aec63136f1fd33fe399cfee9402d464cf76d1c515881860296a95b"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "faxian-legge-jordan-ucsd-36--segment-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "role": "article",
      "text": "Fǎxiǎn, however, whose original purpose had been to secure the introduction of the complete Vinaya rules into the land of Hàn, returned there alone.",
      "textSha256": "eea32ba353af93d205ade41a13f2d303b79a97996fa9a17a0fdb6208a9540967",
      "sourceTag": "javascript-string-literal",
      "sourceAssignment": "eng[12]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 7138,
          "endByte": 7291,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "afe3020d9b8b19c28c543cbd15f9324eb4c7ae5d6ae85b75121c04c7d41ae8e4"
        }
      ],
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 12
    }
  ],
